{"id": "EUVD-2026-84819", "enisaUuid": "e67ada13-e38b-3323-b309-99477bbc1678", "description": "MPXJ is an open source library to read and write project plans from a variety of file formats and databases. From 7.3.0 until 16.5.0, reading a suitably crafted Primavera P3 PRX or SureTrak STX file can cause MPXJ to write files to arbitrary locations in the filesystem. This issue is fixed in version 16.5.0.", "datePublished": "2026-09-22T19:54:19", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-23T12:41:05", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:N", "references": ["https://github.com/joniles/mpxj/security/advisories/GHSA-7952-gx68-cjqr", "https://github.com/joniles/mpxj/commit/4347315afab1ef5a2907978a754fbc5b0ff58e6f", "https://github.com/joniles/mpxj/releases/tag/v16.5.0"], "aliases": ["GHSA-7952-gx68-cjqr", "CVE-2026-65829", "PYSEC-2026-4108"], "assigner": "GitHub_M", "epss": 0.33, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d537b334-eaa4-303c-bfbf-cd45a47e0435", "product": {"name": "mpxj", "vendor": {"name": "joniles"}}, "product_version": "7.3.0, < 16.5.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c2b4ad40-9da9-3e8f-a869-e6ae9fe70147", "vendor": {"name": "joniles"}}], "isExploited": false}